avatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":4474728,"digest":"sha256:b3bffd3bb647eddeef8d894091d1dd8ef14ba0354a620be2ea8a10ac94be8b52","download_count":29,"created_at":"2026-11-08T10:57:56Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T10:57:57Z"}],"body":"## [1.2.0](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/compare/v1.1.0...v1.2.0) (2026-11-08)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **git:** fold ls-tree path listings by directory ([#1816](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/1816))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **analytics:** sum per-project ccusage rows in monthly economics ([#4771](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4771))\n* **cargo:** keep nextest timeouts and retried failures ([#4697](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4697))\n* **cicd:** build the deb, rpm and aarch64 Linux binaries as static musl ([#5017](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/5017))\n* **dotnet:** preserve discovery and classic TRX reports ([#4628](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4628))\n* **gain:** distinguish filtered timings from passthrough lifetimes ([#4677](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4677))\n* **git:** announce the cap on the filtered `git log` path ([#4152](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4152))\n* **hermes:** close the rewrite's stdin and make its timeout configurable ([#3833](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/3833))\n* **hook:** honour opt-outs inside a quoted script behind uv run ([3467fb2](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/commit/3467fb24c155aa1b4c6aca71e76b3d37798be9c3))\n* **hook:** preserve fish-wrap decisions and reuse permission scans ([#4785](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4785))\n* **hook:** rewrite commands without rewriting the text between them ([#4132](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4132))\n* **hook:** skip proxy autostart on occupied loopback ports ([#4778](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4778))\n* **hooks:** honour exclude_commands for a swapped program called by path ([#5019](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/5019))\n* **hooks:** preserve host checks when settings cannot be loaded ([#4680](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4680))\n* **init:** install the OpenCode plugin independently of agent setup ([#4740](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4740))\n* **init:** return exit code 2 when codex uninstall guard refuses hook (fixes [#4164](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4164)) ([#4463](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4463))\n* **init:** scope guidance to external commands ([#4175](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4175))\n* **lexer:** classify heredocs before /dev/null exemption ([#4666](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4666))\n* **lint:** route SQLFluff file shortcuts through lint ([#4683](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4683))\n* **ls:** hold a bare listing to what ls prints, not to the long listing rtk asks for ([#4833](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4833))\n* **permissions:** ignore NotADirectory and strip BOM before empty check ([#4658](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4658))\n* **pipe:** preserve non-JSON Go test reports ([#4455](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4455))\n* **pipeline:** swap commands rtk has no filter for ([#4685](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4685))\n* **read:** fall back to raw bytes when a plain read is not valid UTF-8 ([#4066](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4066))\n* **read:** separate line numbers with a tab ([#4647](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4647))\n* **read:** window the tracking baseline like the output, so a partial read is not booked as a saving ([#3943](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/3943))\n* **ruff:** route flag-first implicit check invocations to check ([#3927](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/3927)) ([#3968](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/3968))\n\n\n### Performance Improvements\n\n* **hook:** use mimalloc as the global allocator on musl builds ([#4461](https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk/issues/4461))","reactions":{"total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
